{"id":"n24053-1-8","stage":3,"title":"교육비 · 学费","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24053-1-8-1","ko":"한국은 교육비가 그렇게 비싸다면서요?","zh":"听说韩国的教育费用那么高吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"한국은","meaning":"韩国","explanation":"한국：韩国；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"한국은","audio":"/audio/d6df57a5ee32b45ff17c.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한국은","audio":"/audio/d6df57a5ee32b45ff17c.mp3"}},{"text":"교육비가","meaning":"学费，教育费用","explanation":"교육비：学费，教育费用；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"교육비","audio":"/audio/09ad7ef51ac5626c217b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24053","senseId":"1","lemma":"교육비","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"교육비가","audio":"/audio/e51d1414cb8e19cee59d.mp3"}},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그렇게","audio":"/audio/b470a873a66143d27846.mp3"}},{"text":"비싸다면서요?","meaning":"贵","explanation":"비싸다：贵；다면서：引用所听到的话，向对方确认，非敬语。；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"비싸다","audio":"/audio/063c1a7bb93233dcd205.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66318","senseId":"1","lemma":"비싸다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"비싸다면서요","audio":"/audio/fdb03710ff6f3522d7ad.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"09ad7ef51ac5626c","term":"교육비","zh":"学费，教育费用","audio":"/audio/09ad7ef51ac5626c217b.mp3","entryId":"24053","definition":"教育方面花的费用。","pronunciation":["교ː육삐"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"063c1a7bb93233dc","term":"비싸다","zh":"贵","audio":"/audio/063c1a7bb93233dcd205.mp3","entryId":"66318","definition":"物品的价格或做某事所花的费用高于一般水平。","pronunciation":["비싸다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ccb62ec65669fa806e88.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n24053-1-8-2","ko":"네. 아마 학원이나 과외 같은 사교육이 많아서 그렇겠지요.","zh":"是的。大概是因为有大量的补习班或家教这类课外辅导吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"아마","meaning":"也许","explanation":"아마：也许","readings":[{"term":"아마","audio":"/audio/2a38de25ef5f5194f0a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71248","senseId":"1","lemma":"아마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아마","audio":"/audio/2a38de25ef5f5194f0a9.mp3"}},{"text":"학원이나","meaning":"补习班，培训班","explanation":"학원：补习班，培训班；이나：连接可以选择的名词，表示“或、或者”。","readings":[{"term":"학원","audio":"/audio/a34f3f1b2a44f15f7e22.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72425","senseId":"2","lemma":"학원","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"학원이나","audio":"/audio/ea85cc84556386a76390.mp3"}},{"text":"과외","meaning":"课外补习，课外辅导","explanation":"과외：课外补习，课外辅导","readings":[{"term":"과외","audio":"/audio/01d9386913b8be49a930.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23962","senseId":"2","lemma":"과외","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"과외","audio":"/audio/01d9386913b8be49a930.mp3"}},{"text":"같은","meaning":"那样的，类似的","explanation":"같다：那样的，类似的；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"3","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같은","audio":"/audio/9dce73570f65f8a11961.mp3"}},{"text":"사교육이","meaning":"私人教育，私营教育","explanation":"사교육：私人教育，私营教育；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사교육","audio":"/audio/7696918a091aef5577d7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62034","senseId":"1","lemma":"사교육","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사교육이","a